OL,3,GNEWSAWheelbarrows worth #8,000 stolen
OL,4,Afrom firm
OL,5,
OL,6,FAbout #8,000 worth of wheelbarrows have
OL,7,Fbeen stolen from a concrete business
OL,8,Fover eight weeks, police have said.
OL,10,FLancashire Police said Chorley
OL,11,FConcrete, in Appley Bridge, Lancashire,
OL,12,Fhad been targeted about twice a week
OL,13,Fover that time.
OL,15,FOfficers said roughly four wheelbarrows
OL,16,Fhad been taken each week.
OL,18,FTwo men, aged 32 and 58, both from
OL,19,FPreston, were arrested on Tuesday on
OL,20,Fsuspicion of burglary.
